-- A pipe from the ground up, leaving a gap above it.
--
-- The gap is drawn, not computed: rows 11 to 17 are clear here and in
-- highpipe.dmtl too, so however the stream orders the chunks there is always
-- a way through. A vocabulary with a property like that is worth more than
-- one with more pieces in it.

tile #  pipe   solid  brick.svg
tile _  ground solid  ledge.svg

